# Declarative map of every credential the protected release lanes need.
#
# FORMAT (whitespace separated, four columns):
#   <github-environment>  <secret-name>  <source>  <required|optional>
#
# A source is either an `op://<vault>/<item-uuid>/<field>` 1Password reference,
# or a `derive:` rule the script computes.
#
# ITEMS ARE ADDRESSED BY UUID, NEVER BY TITLE. `op read` accepts only its own
# reference grammar and rejects anything outside it, and every title here uses
# an en dash, so the title form cannot resolve at all. A UUID also survives the
# item being renamed. Run `--fields` to regenerate these references.
#
# NOTHING IN THIS FILE IS A CREDENTIAL. It names where credentials come from,
# not what they are, and a UUID is useless without access to the vault. It is
# committed deliberately so the credential surface of this repository is
# reviewable in the tree.
# The `env-local-file:` source names the path to an external private key in
# the Git-ignored repository-root .env.local. The key file itself stays
# outside the checkout and is streamed directly to GitHub; never commit the
# local configuration or key file.

# Keepling - B2 Primary Backup.
# The endpoint and region are DERIVED, not stored. They are not independent
# facts -- they are determined by the account the application key belongs to,
# and b2_authorize_account states them. A transcribed copy would just be a
# second place for them to be wrong.
phase-2-protected-environment  KEEPLING_BACKUP_PRIMARY_ENDPOINT    derive:b2-s3-endpoint                                    required
phase-2-protected-environment  KEEPLING_BACKUP_PRIMARY_REGION      derive:b2-s3-region                                      required
phase-2-protected-environment  KEEPLING_BACKUP_PRIMARY_ACCESS_KEY  op://Personal/pvdsx37purgqzwndrokc5pif4a/keyID           required
phase-2-protected-environment  KEEPLING_BACKUP_PRIMARY_SECRET_KEY  op://Personal/pvdsx37purgqzwndrokc5pif4a/applicationKey  required

# Keepling - Hetzner Provisioning.
phase-2-protected-environment  HCLOUD_TOKEN                        op://Personal/oi7dzaxhzlqtynnmdypmkzaa6y/token           required
phase-2-protected-environment  KEEPLING_SSH_PRIVATE_KEY             env-local-file:KEEPLING_SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE              required

# Keepling - Cloudflare DNS Cutover.
phase-2-protected-environment  CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN                op://Personal/n4aewxzk6kbcqlmwsoearpmcti/token           required

# Exact additional field references used by tooling/materialize-phase-2-credentials.sh.
